# .trivyignore
#
# Trivy Vulnerability Exemption List
#
# Use this file to exempt false positives or approved, documented risks
# from blocking the CI/CD release pipeline.
#
# Format:
#   <CVE-ID or GHSA-ID>
#
# Guidelines:
# 1. Every entry MUST include:
#    - Date of exemption
#    - Approver / decider
#    - Reference Jira/GitHub issue
#    - Technical rationale (e.g., unreachable code, unexploitable in context, upstream patch pending)
#    - Target expiration / review date
# 2. Never suppress vulnerabilities without team review and approval.
#
# Example:
#   # 2026-11-09 | Approver: Security Team | Ref: Issue #288 | Rationale: Dev-only mock artifact
#   # CVE-2026-00000
